@startuml
title Agent Runtime 工作流

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "Agent Chat" as Chat
participant "Agent Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Context Builder" as Context
participant "Tool Registry" as Tools
participant "Permission Gate" as Gate
participant "LLM Provider Adapter" as LLM
participant "本地能力模块" as LocalTools
database "App SQLite" as DB

User -> Chat: 输入消息 / 选择上下文
Chat -> Runtime: createRun(message, options)
Runtime -> Context: 构建上下文
Context -> DB: 读取会话、任务、偏好
Context -> Runtime: 返回上下文包
Runtime -> Tools: 查询可用工具
Tools -> Runtime: 返回工具定义
Runtime -> LLM: 请求模型响应
LLM -> Runtime: 返回回答或工具调用请求

alt 需要工具调用
  Runtime -> Gate: 校验工具权限和参数
  Gate -> Runtime: 允许执行
  Runtime -> LocalTools: 执行工具
  LocalTools -> Runtime: 返回结果
  Runtime -> LLM: 提交工具结果继续推理
  LLM -> Runtime: 返回最终结果
end

Runtime -> DB: 保存消息、工具调用、日志、结果
Runtime -> Chat: 流式输出或最终结果
Chat -> User: 展示回答、引用、工具记录

@enduml
